/
/	THE FOLLOWING PAGE CONTAINS ALL OF THE UTILITY ROUTINES
/	USED BY THE PAGE 1, AND PAGE 2 ROUTINES, PLUS THE ASSOCIATED
/				DATA AREAS.
/
