/102	HLP	14-JAN-83	Make ESC-[?10-anything be a drafter printer
/				  so will respond to both LA50 and LA100PC
/101	MJS	23-DEC-82	-only "moved code around" allowing for a
/				 clean DECmate I or DECmate I assembly
/				 from the same WPSYS.PA
/
/100	HLP	20-DEC-82	Fix LQP02 SE parser--not recognizing
/				  E[?2xn type reports
