/				-fixed hyphen-push/pull broken this time
/				 by the firmware...( "pp" redefined to 34)
/				-changed flavor of "DTR" (negative logic)
/				 that means 0 sets and 1 clears
/				-fixed "SRCH" to beep invalid key strokes, and
/				 ("GOLD..GOLD" treated as 1 "GOLD")
/				 ("ESC....ESC" treated as 1 "ESC")
/				-redefined "NODEF" = 4400 (from 4000)
