/0004	DIM	23-SEPT-80	Merge with x3.5
/0003	DM,JM	15-SEPT-80	MERGED SCANDI AND EUROPE/ENGLISH
/0002	DSS	09-JUL-80	MODIFIED FOR ENGLISH/FRENCH-CANADIAN
/0001	GLT	 9-Apr-80	Fixed bug in German character map table
