U1ICHR,	XX
	GETRTF 			/ ++++
	DCA	U1ICHX 		/ GET RETURN FIELD
	TAD	U1ICNT 		/ ANYTHING THERE?
	SNA CLA 		/ ++++
	JMP	U1ICX 		/ RETURN 0 IF NOTR
	TAD I	U1IGET 		/ GET CHAR
	SPA 			/ ++++
	DCA	U1IGET 		/ WRAP IF NEC.
	CIF 0
	AC7777 			/ ++++
	TAD	U1ICNT 		/ ++++
	DCA	U1ICNT
	TAD I	U1IGET
	ISZ	U1IGET 		/ BUMP PTR
	ISZ	U1ICHR		/ BUMP RETURN ADDRESS.
	JMP	U1ICHX		/ EXIT					/A034
U1ICX,	JMS	U1ARON		/ TURN AUTO-REPEAT BACK ON.		/A034
U1ICHX,	CIF CDF .-. 		/ MAP CALLER FIELD.
