				/ SET FLAG TO MINUS TO INDICATE A GETSTX/A030
	JMS	SCGETR 		/ GET BLOCK NUMBER
	SCTPH			/ TOP HEADER POINTER			/A003
	SCTOP			/ TOP HEADER WORD POINTER		/A003
