IFDEF ENGLSH <LINSTD,	TEXT '&N/&A  &C:!Y'>	/ LINE NUMBER NOT AVAILABLE	/C235
IFDEF V30NOR <LINSTD,	TEXT '&I/&T  &K:!Y'>	/ LINE NUMBER NOT AVAILABLE	/C235
IFDEF V30SWE <LINSTD,	TEXT '&I/&T  &K:!Y'>	/ LINE NUMBER NOT AVAILABLE	/C235
IFDEF SPANISH <LINSTD,	TEXT '&N/&A  &C:!Y'>	/ LINE NUMBER NOT AVAILABLE/A255
IFDEF DUTCH <LINSTD,	TEXT '?  &T:!Y'>	/ LINE NUMBER NOT AVAILABLE		/C235

	X=.			/ INDICATE FIRST FREE LOCATION ON PAGE
