	DCA I	X0 		/ CLEAR ONE LOCATION
	ISZ	X1 		/ SKIP IF: FINISHED
	JMP	.-2 		/ NOT FINISHED! DO THE NEXT LOCATION!

	TAD	(ECBFND) 	/ INSTALL BUFFER_END CHARACTER
	DCA I	X0

