	 MNTMP1								/a176

	TAD	VECFLG		/ HOW DID WE GET HERE			/a176
	SZA	CLA							/a176
	 JMP	RLCOND		/ GOLD:TAB				/a176
/
	OVLJMP			/ GOLD:RULER
	 OVXRL1
