XVTIME,	CIFMNU
	JMS I	TIMCAL
	NOP			/ UPDATE TIMER
	CDFMNU
	AC7777
	TAD I	(DATESP)	/ GET DATE STRING
	DCA	OVTIMX		/ SAVE PTR-1
XVTIM1,	CDFMNU
