/									/
/	CHKID2--ROUTINE TO TELL OPERATOR TO RE-INSTALL THE		/
/		ORIGINAL SYSTEM DISK (HAS SAME DISK ID)			/
/		GOLD MENU IS ONLY LEGAL CHAR ACCEPTED			/
/	ROUTINE ADDED V036 AS CPYINS					/
/	ACTUALLY IS PART OF CHKID ROUTINE				/
/									/
