/	JUST CALL IT WITH A JMS ////					/A014
/									/A036
/	REWRITTEN TO USE GENERAL PURPOSE CONTROL STRINGS		/A036
/									/A014
/***********************************************************************/A014

CPYASK,	XX			/ RETURN ADDRESS			/A014
	TAD	(0050)		/ ERASE DATE & TIME BUT NOT TITLE	/A057
	JMS	CLRSCR		/ GO CLEAR THE SCREEN			/
	CIFMNU								/
									/
	JMS I	IOACAL		/					/
	0								/
