TIMMSG,	XX 								
	CLA
	CDFMNU 			/ CLEAR THE TIME COUNTER
	DCA I	(CLKCHG)
	CDFMYF
/
	DCA	SEC 		/ CLEAR THE SECOND COUNTER
	DCA	MIN 		/ AND THE MINUTES
/
	CIFMNU
	JMS I	IOACAL 		/ PRINT "ELAPSED TIME CLOCK  0:00"
	0 			/ DEFAULT OUTPUT ROUTINE
	TEXT12 			/ ADDRESS OF STRING
	IFNDEF ITALIAN <0050>	/ CURSOR POSITION TO CLEAR FROM		/C057
	IFDEF ITALIAN <0053>	/   (LEAVE MENU NAME BUT CLEAR DATE/TM	/A057
