	TEXT '^P!E     ^P&E&L&A&P&S&E&D &T&I&M&E &C&L&O&C&K   0:00'
	>
/
/	THE "0:00" HAS BEEN REMOVED FROM THE FOREIGN TRANSLATIONS BECAUSE IT IS NOT
/	ACTUALLY NEEDED AS THE "0:00" IS NEVER ON THE SCREEN FOR MORE THAN A SECOND
/	AND "0:00" IS PRINTED ANYWAY BY THE TIME ROUTINE.
/
	
