  0143    /143 (OCTAL) WORDS FOR A SINGLE SIDED RX50 DRIVE/M042
  0143    /143 (OCTAL) WORDS FOR A SINGLE SIDED RX50 DRIVE/A042
  0143    /143 (OCTAL) WORDS FOR A SINGLE SIDED RX50 DRIVE/A042

