/TD056  DCA  T2
/TD056  TAD  (-14
/TD056  DCA  T3
/TD056  DCA  RPBPTR
/TD056CPYR1,  TAD I  T2
/TD056  SPA
/TD056  JMP  CPYR2    /RETURN IF ANY PTR IS -1
/D056
/D056  TAD  (HDR4BF+362  /SET UP LOOP TO CHECK EXTRA EXT BLOCKS  /TA056
/D056  DCA  T2              /TA056
/D056  TAD  (-15              /TA056
/D056  DCA  T3              /TA056
/D056  TAD  (VBLKBF              /TA056
/D056  DCA  RPBPTR              /TA056
