/D056  SNA      /ZERO IS THE EXTENSION BLOCK TERMINATOR  /TA056
/D056  JMP  CPYR2    /RETURN ON 0        /TA056
/D056
/D056  DCA  BLKIN
/D056  TAD  RPBPTR
/D056  JMS  READIN    /READ IN THE RPG BLOCK      /M054
/D056  JMS  WRTEXT    /WRITE IT OUT TO THE COPY DEVICE  /M056
/D056  ISZ  T2
/D056  ISZ  T3
/D056  JMP  CPYR1
/D056CPYR2,  CLA
/D056  TAD  (HDR2BF+3
/D056  DCA  T2
/D056  TAD  (HDR4BF
/D056  DCA  RPBPTR
/D056  JMS  WRTEXT              /M056
/D056CPYR3,  TAD  (HDR2BF+2
/D056  DCA  T2
/D056  TAD  (HDR3BF
/D056  DCA  RPBPTR
/D056  JMS  WRTEXT              /M056
