QURX,  XX
  CLA
  RDF      /GET THE CURRENT DATA FIELD    /A054
  TAD  CDF0    /ADD THE CHANGE DATA FIELD INSTRUCTION  /A054
  DCA  DESFLD    /TELL RXHAN WHICH FIELD GETS THE DATA  /A054
  CDFMYF                /A050
  TAD  DRIVE    /GET DRIVE/DEVICE NUMBER    /C042
  DCA  QUQBLK+RXQDRV  /IN QBLK
  TAD I  QURX
