  ISZ  QURX
  TAD I  QURX
  DCA  QUQBLK+RXQBAD  /BUFFER ADDRESS
  ISZ  QURX
  CIF 0
  ENQUE
  QUQB
QURX1,  CIF 0
  JWAIT
  TAD  QUQBLK+RXQCOD  /DONE YET?
