  SMA CLA      /IF ERROR, TAKE FIRST RETURN    /A050
  ISZ  QURX    /ELSE BUMP POINTER FOR OK RETURN  /A050
  JMP I  QURX    /RETURN          /C050
QUQB,  DSKQUE
  0
