  CIA      /COMPARE IT TO        /M054
  TAD  FILENO    /THE CURRENT HOME FILE #    /M054
  SNA CLA
  JMP  RHD1    /EXIT
RHD2,  AC2000      /MARK AS UNREADABLE IN THE BLOCK LIST  /M054
  JMS  IORBLK    /STATUS WORD, FORCES DELETE LATER  /M054
