/D056  TAD  FLAG    /IS READ SUPRESSED?
/D056  SNA CLA      /IF <>0 THEN READ IS SUPPRESSED, SKIP  /A054

CPYEX8,  TAD  (VBLKBF    /PASS THE BUFFER ADDRESS TO READIN  /A056
