/	038	HLP	10-JUN-83	CHANGE PRINTER PAGE SIZE FROM CT TO
/					SIZE OF LAST DOCUMENT PRINTED
/	037	DFB	31-MAY-83	FIX TO HALT WHEN CX TD
/	036	GDH	18-MAY-83	MOVED LARGE BUFFER TO FIELD 6.
/	035	GDH	14-APR-83	ALTER RETURN TO MAIN MENU CODE TO
/					CALL COMM CLEANUP CODE.
/	034	GDH	1-APR-83	FIX SO THAT HD REMEMBERS DOC NAME.
/	033	HLP	25-FEB-83	PRASF NOW PART OF LPONLN
