/ROUTINES FOR ACCESSING DOCUMENTS

PMESFN,	XX
	CIFMNU			/INSERT A CDF TO THE MENU FIELD
	JMS I	MNUCAL		/CALL MENU
	DLMCM1

	AC7776
	CDFMNU
