/PUT THE ERROR TYPE INTO A TEMP TO CALL THE MENU.
/THEN, CLEAN UP AS FOLLOWS -
/CLEAR ALL ACTION FLAGS TO STOP ALL NON-DISK JOBS
/CLEAR ERROR INDICATION FLAG (ERFLG)
/CLOSE ANY DISK INPUT FILE (CALL DKACTS ONCE)
/FINALLY, CALL THE ERROR MENU TO DISPLAY THE ERROR.

CRTERR,	AC0001

