	DCA I	(DSKRLF)	/CLEAR THE FLAG USED BY DSKGCH THAT	/A047
				/SAYS IT IS IN THE MIDDLE OF A RULER	/A047
	DCA I	(DSKSTF)	/CLEAR THE FLAG IN DSKGCH THAT SAYS TO
				/GET INPUT FROM A BUFFER AND NOT RDFILL	/A047
	AC7776
	DCA I	(DSKSOD)	/SET FOR FIRST TIME THROUGH DSKGCH	/A047
	DCA I	(DSKBAK)	/CLEAR THE TEMP CHAR WHEN LOOKIN FOR SOD/A047
	DCA I	(DSKSOL)	/CLEAR THE START OF LINE FLAG		/A047
	CDFMYF								/A047
	TAD	ITFILE
	CIFFIO
	FILEIO
	XRDFIN
	JMP I	CXRDOP

/OPEN THE OUTPUT FILE IF THERE IS ONE WAITING TO OPEN

