/
/	THE STARTING ADDRESSES OF THE BUFFERS
/	THIS IS THE AREA THAT IS USED FOR THE DEFAULT SETTINGS.  THEY ARE STORED
/	FROM 5000 TO ABOUT 6000 MOST OF THE UNUSED PORTION IS USED FOR OTHER
/	BUFFERS AND INFORMATION IT IS ALWAYS IN COREAND WRITTEN OUT IF THERE IS A
/	MODIFICATION TO THE AREA.
