/
/	THIS ROUTINE WILL CHANGE THE BUFFER LENGTH IN THE MENU FIELD	/A034
/	AND SAVE THE OLD VALUE IN T1.					/A034
/	UPON RETURN FROM THE MENU CALL THE OLD VALUE MUST BE RESTORED	/A034
/

A19SET,	XX			/					/A034
	CLA			/					/A034
	CDFMNU			/					/A034
	TAD I	(MUBUF+MNILEN)	/ FETCH VALUE USED BY THE SYSTEM	/A034
	CDFMYF			/					/A034
