	CDFMYF
/
	DCA	DATEAD
/
	CIFMNU
	JMS I	TIMCAL 		/ SEE IF THE TIME HAS CHANGED
	NOP
/
	JMS	CUCOPY 		/ COPY THE TIME TO THIS FIELD
DATEAD,	0
	CDFMNU
	AXTIM
	CDFMYF
	26
/
	JMS	CUPSH2 		/ SKIP OVER THE HEADER AND RULER STUFF
/
	TAD	AXSRNO 		/ BREAK OUT FILE AND DRIVE NUMBERS
	AND	P377
	DCA	CUPDAT
