	JMP	CONTAP		/CONTINUE ON A PAGE THAT HAS ROOM	/A084

POSTEX,	JMP I	CPOSTP		/NEED COMMON EXIT ON THIS PAGE(INCL.ERR	/A084

	IFDEF CANADA <							/A017
CULSBT,	TEXT "AJOUT[   LA FIN DU "					/M023
		>	/END IFDEF CANADA				/A017
