/
/	DECKDS - DISPLYS THE NAME PORTION OF THE CURRENT
/	RECORD TO THE SCREEN
/
DECKDS,	XX
DECKL3,	CLA
/D044	CDFBUF
/D044	TAD I	X2
/D044	CDFMYF
