BLDQR0,	XX			/REQUEST A DISK FUNCTION & HANDLE ERRORS/A001
	JMS	QURX		/QUEUE THE DISK REQUEST			/M022
	SMA CLA			/WAS THERE AN ERROR ?			/M022
