		CUIFNO
		CDFMYF
CUIN4A,		0
		CDFMYF
		STRLEN+1	
	TAD	CUIREM	/END OF DOCUMENTS?				/M016
	SNA CLA								/M016
	JMP	CUIND5	/YES
	ISZ	CUICNT	/NEXT?
	JMP	CUIND4
