	COMBIT!LPBIT!SRBIT!MABIT / TURN ON SYSTEM OPTIONS		/C030
			>	/ END IFDEF UNBUND			/A019

	IFNDEF	UNBUND	< -1 >	/ MAKE SURE ALL OPTIONS ARE ACTIVE	/A019

*MNXDLY-X;	5		/ MNXDLY is used as a multiplier to mod	/A013
				/ the time out delays for DX		/A013

