	CIA
/D033	TAD (CUDXBF+CUBFSZ-1 	/ ADDR OF END OF BUFFER			
	TAD XBFEND		/ ADDR. OF END OF BUFFER 2		/A033
	SZA CLA
	JMP CUDIL8		/ BUFFER NOT EMPTY, CONTINUE

