	TAD CUDPTR
	CIA
	TAD CUDILA		/ CONSTANT TO ADJUST FOR SPACE LEFT
/D033	TAD (CUDXBF+CUBFSZ-1
	TAD XBFEND		/ ADDR. OF END OF BUFFER 2		/A033
/D033	SZA CLA
