/
/	PMTANS - WILL DISPLAY THE PROMPT AND WAIT FOR A RESPONSE
/
PMTANS,	DCA	PMTTMP 		/ CLEAR THE REAL PROMPT FLAG FOR OTHERS TO BE ALLOWED
	DCA	PMTFLG 		/ WHILE THIS ONE IS BEING ANSWERED
	DCA	INBUFA 		/ CLEAR THE BUFFER FOR THE PROMT TO WORK CORRECTLY
	JMS	INITKF 		/ INITALIZE THE TOKEN POINTER TO BEGINING OF BUFFER
	TAD	PMTTMP 		/ SEE IF IT IS A DOCUMENT MOD PROMPT (4)
