	SNA CLA			/ IS THIS THE END OF THE STRING?	/A018
	JMP	THENOK		/ YES, FINISHED COMPARE			/A018
	JMS	PGTCHR		/ GET A CHARCTACTER			/A018
	JMP I	PZERR		/ EOF					/A018
	MQL			/ SAVE FOR COMPARE			/A018
	TAD I	THENCT		/ GET THE OTHER CHAR BACK		/A018
	JMS	PCMPAR		/ NO, DO THE COMPARE			/A018
	JMP I	PZERR		/ NO MATCH FOUND			/A018
	ISZ	THENCT		/ INCRAMENT THE STRING POINTER		/A018
	JMP	PTHENL		/ GO ROUND FOR THE NEXT CHARACTER	/A018
