/    SELCT *** MUST *** RESIDE AT ADDRESS ZERO OF A PAGE.		/A019
/     IF MATH DETECTS AN ERROR, IT WILL MAKE A RETURN TO SELCTX.	/A042
/      THIS ROUTINE IS CROSS FIELD CALLABLE BECAUSE OF AN EDITOR CALL	/A042

SELCT,	0	/MAIN ROUTINE TO MATCH AND SELECT RECORDS
		/CALLED BY:
		/CIFLP							/M017
		/JMS I	(SELCT)
