	TAD I	(SPECTB		/GET FIRST TYPE WORD
	SNA
	JMP	CKTRU		/0 TYPE, PROCESS ALL RECORDS
	SPA CLA			/SEE IF 'TRUE' (POS.)
	JMP	CKNG2		/NO, LOOK FOR A 'TRUE' ENTRY
