	/THIS ROUTINE CHECKS TO SEE IF THE RECORD NUMBER IS WITHIN	/A042
	/THE RANGE OF THE FROM - TO SETTINGS.  IT ALSO CHECKS TO SEE	/A042
	/IF THE HALT FLAG IS SET BY THE USER PRESSING GOLD-HALT		/A042
