				/  MENU DEPENDING ON THE ERROR NUMBER.	/A025
				/   IF MNTMP5 = 0 THEN EXIT ELSE PRINT	/A025
				/    MATH CONTROL BLOCK LINE THAT 	/A025
				/     CONTAINS THE ERROR THEN RETURN TO	/A025
				/       MENU TO PRINT RECORDS SELECTED	/A025
				/	 AND PROCESSED.			/A025
	CDFMYF								/A025
	SNA CLA			/ SKIP IF: NEED TO PRINT ERROR LINE	/A025
