	TAD	(600		/ TELL PELINE TO PRINT ON LINE 7	/A035
	CIFMTH			/ CHANGE INSTRUCTION FIELD TO MATH FIELD/A025
	JMS	PELINE		/ PRINT LINE IN CONTROL BLOCK THAT	/A025
				/  CONTAINS THE ERROR AND POINT TO	/A025
				/   ERROR				/A025

