	DCA	CRPOS	/ STORE POSITION FOR CURSOR
	CIFMNU
	JMS I	IOACAL
	  0
	  PSCR		/ STRING TO ERASE SCREEN AND POSITION CURSOR
CRPOS,	0000		/ CURSOR POSITION PASSED IN AC FROM CALLER
	JMP I	ERASE	/ RETURN

PRETURN,XX		/ DISPLAYS 'and press return
	CIFMNU
	JMS I	IOACAL
	  0
	  PRTRN
	  2305
	JMP I	PRETURN

