/ NOTE THAT A <SPACE> DOES NOT EXIST BETWEEN THE WORDS 'SORT' AND 'ON'
/ BECAUSE THE SUBROUTINE ( 'RD1CHR' ) WHICH GETS A CHARACTER
/ FROM THE SPECIFICATION DOCUMENT IGNORES <SPACES> IF ENTERED WITH THE AC=0
/
/ THEREFORE THE SUBROUTINE 'TXTCOM' WHICH COMPARES TWO CHARACTERS
/ ( ONE OF WHICH IS A CHARACTER FROM THE SPEC DOC) - IGNORES <SPACES>
/
