	JMS PSHLST	/PUSH VALUES ONTO OUTPUT LIST			/A041

/D041/HOOK HERE TO PROCESS EDITOR MATH SYMBOLS ":Dnn" & ":Tnn", IF IN	/A030
/D041/EDITOR MATH THEN GO PROCESS SYMBOLS BEING PUT IN THE TABLE. IF	/A030
