	IFDEF 	V30SWE <
	TEXT	'&TILL N\DSTA POST: TRYCK P\E RETUR'>
	IFDEF	DUTCH <
	TEXT	/&OR &JUST &PRESS &RETURN TO GET THE &NEXT &ENTRY/>
	IFDEF	SPANISH <
	TEXT	/&OR &JUST &PRESS &RETURN TO GET THE &NEXT &ENTRY/>



